{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183/events","html_url":"https://github.com/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183","id":34081093,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUzNDA4MTA5Mw==","number":3183,"title":"multiclass OVO, estimator must implement predict_proba","user":{"login":"dlangenk","id":4822085,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MjIwODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4822085?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk","html_url":"https://github.com/dlangenk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dlangenk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":12995755,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMjk5NTc1NQ==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/labels/Bug","name":"Bug","color":"e10c02","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2014-05-22T13:25:46Z","updated_at":"2014-05-23T09:42:05Z","closed_at":"2014-05-23T09:42:05Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"In the documentation (http://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/generated/sklearn.multiclass.OneVsOneClassifier.html)\nthe following is stated:\n\nestimator : estimator object\nAn estimator object implementing fit and predict.\n\nBut in fact the estimator must implement predict_proba.\n\nCall graph:\n\n```\nclf=sklearn.multiclass.OneVsOneClassifier(estimator)\nclf.predict(X)\n    predict_ovo(self.estimators_, self.classes_, X)\n           score = _predict_binary(estimators[k], X)\n                   score = estimator.predict_proba(X)[:, 1]\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"larsmans","id":335383,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTM4Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/335383?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans","html_url":"https://github.com/larsmans","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larsmans/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scikit-learn/scikit-learn/issues/3183/timeline","performe